cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "cnbs-predictor"
abstract: >-
  A tool to forecast the components of Net Basin Supply (NBS) —
  precipitation, evaporation, runoff, and NBS — for the Laurentian Great
  Lakes, using NOAA Climate Forecast System (CFS) data out to twelve months
  at monthly intervals.
